{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Something moved... but it\u2019s not in the photo anymore.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the haunted halls of <strong>Mugen no Gakkou</strong>, a lonely Japanese school. As a rookie investigator for a clandestine paranormal research team, your only tools are your camera and your instincts. Document the anomalies. Survive the school. Don\u2019t trust your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by Japanese psychological horror and anomaly-spotting games, <i><strong>Paranormal Snap Shot</strong></i> is a tense, atmospheric experience where every detail matters. Rooms may twist when you look away. Ghostly silhouettes may flicker just behind your back. You won\u2019t fight. You won\u2019t run. You\u2019ll only <i>snap... and pray it was enough.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337630/extras/Gif_GuardGlitch.gif?t=1744945226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anomaly Hunting Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Detect, document, and photograph anything out of place in looping, shifting environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Reality fractures the longer you stay. Expect classic Japanese horror vibes and subtle, creeping terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Hard Mode</strong> \u2013 For players who want a greater challenge and even more disturbing encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secret Ending</strong> \u2013 A deeper layer of the mystery awaits, if you can find it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easter Eggs</strong> \u2013 Hidden nods, cryptic clues, and rewards for the curious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Time</strong> \u2013 1\u20132 hours per run, with extra replay value for full completionists.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337630/extras/Gif_GhostLocker.gif?t=1744945226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your camera ready. Not everything wants to be seen\u2014<i>but they see you.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"5 Anomalies Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/4973ba58d74afa1a5c388f099cebbb36141a9c9b.jpg"},{"name":"10 Anomalies Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/386818937922b6a5c749d5353839a93e84ab0c93.jpg"},{"name":"30 Anomalies Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/d2048d82c4df66a6a4556f4ca2f6ffbd986d8726.jpg"},{"name":"60 Anomalies Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/bf94ce099c2e3ad566b36f7f17baa3f902795f5f.jpg"},{"name":"First Anomaly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/13ae5f88e5a259258cb241e1c8bf98b2684640d9.jpg"},{"name":"All Anomalies Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/eab6c3026f9c917484ebd4c41fab64cd0c06435b.jpg"},{"name":"Normal Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/79131dc76ca281c1e1e277eec60691897d7f87de.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/669bc2be3c9f11b700f17971e04117bc7cf1175a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337630/cb2b4f52b2afb655fd9baa5316cd16f52862a124.jpg"},{"name":"GOAL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea